+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to hash passwords with argon2id. It was chosen because it is a memory-hard algorithm that is much harder to crack, including against GPU/ASIC-accelerated brute-force attacks. No parameter values (memory cost, iterations, parallelism) are recorded, so none are specified here.
